            "sid": "ZEC 11:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jalula milyango yako, O Lebano, kuti mulilo ukatente misamu yako yakedari. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.11.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.11.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 11:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kolila, O musamu wakupresi, nkaambo musamunyoko mukedari wawa. Misamu yabulemu yanyonyooka! Amulile numibanga yaku-Basani, nkaambo lusaka loonse lulitemedwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.11.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.11.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 11:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amuswiilile beembeli mbubalila! Bulemu bwabo bwamana. Amuswiilile balavu mbubavuluma! Nkaambo iteu lyaku-Jordano lyanyonyooka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.11.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.11.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
